/T (  The Railway Network Simulator is a modular desktop application that allows users to create and simulate simplified railway networks. It supports the placement of cities and industries on a customizable map, construction of railway stations and lines, and real-time simulation of cargo transport based on supply and demand principles.)
/E (  The Railway Network Simulator is a modular desktop application that allows users to create and simulate simplified railway networks. It supports the placement of cities and industries on a customizable map, construction of railway stations and lines, and real-time simulation of cargo transport based on supply and demand principles.)
/Pg 16 0 R
>>
endobj
