<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The Railway Network Simulator is a modular software system developed to simulate the creation and operation of simplified railway networks. The platform provides editors and players with tools to design maps, configure scenarios, build railway infrastructure, manage trains, and run logistics simulations.   It can be used for educational, analytical, or entertainment purposes, enabling users to explore transport planning, cargo flow optimization, and infrastructure expansion strategies in a controlled virtual environment.)
/E (The Railway Network Simulator is a modular software system developed to simulate the creation and operation of simplified railway networks. The platform provides editors and players with tools to design maps, configure scenarios, build railway infrastructure, manage trains, and run logistics simulations.   It can be used for educational, analytical, or entertainment purposes, enabling users to explore transport planning, cargo flow optimization, and infrastructure expansion strategies in a controlled virtual environment.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
